                "text": "Today, @RepTenney, @repkevinhern and I introduced the Small Business Health Options Awareness Act of 2025! This legislation directs the @SBAgov to expand outreach and provide information about the availability of Individual Coverage Health Reimbursement arrangements (ICHRAs), helping small businesses to deliver health care coverage to their employees. \n\nRead More: https://t.co/OELGC8Cbnn",
